    "en": {
      "trackName": "Backgammon: Watch & Phone",
      "description": "Enjoy a simple and focused backgammon experience built for both iPhone and Apple Watch.\n\nPlay against a friend in local player-vs-player mode or challenge the AI and adjust the difficulty to match your level. The game is designed to be easy to pick up while still giving you the full feel of classic backgammon, including bar entry, bearing off, legal move handling, and standard board setup.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Play on iPhone and Apple Watch\n- Local player vs player mode\n- Player vs AI mode\n- Adjustable AI difficulty\n- Standard backgammon rules and numbering\n- Tap-friendly controls for quick play\n- Play offline\n\nWhether you want a fast casual game on your wrist or a more relaxed match on your phone, Backgammon makes it easy to jump in and play.",
